    // type assertion on float64: a bool, a bignum and a string are all excluded,
    // and -0.0 >= 0 is TRUE, so `format(-0.0, "+f")` really does answer
    // "+-0.000000" there. Reproduced rather than repaired.
    if (sign == "+") {
